-- 🐛 A part of where uses a part below it: the parts were opened into
--    let ... in from the top, so once was not there yet. Since the
--    chapter "Making the language sturdier", the parts are put in
--    order first, and this works.
-- where の部品が、下の部品を使う。部品を上から let ... in に開いていた
-- ので、once はまだなかった。「言葉を補強する」の章からは、先に部品を
-- 並べ直すので、これは動く
double x = twice
  where
    twice = once + once
    once = x

double 21
